  "trait_source": "Keep initial source-proven Shy0 and GoodSenseOfHumor2 taps. Read actual PNG labels and green checkmarks to select only unchecked Neat13, Absent-Minded15, and Neurotic16; bounded ordinary scrolling finds rows regardless of gesture distance. Require each visible checkbox/count increment, all five bottom green checks, visible Next, then actual phase16. No game memory or save data is written by validation.",
  "run_baseline": false,
  "appearance_source": "Original ARM camera/FOV/look-at/orientation/projection helpers and real model anchor hierarchy prove gender category118,449/leftarrow646,540 and hair category1802,263/rightarrow1274,581 at full1920x1080 native canvas. One gender arrow toggles the default male NPC0 to female.",
  "save_resume_source": "Actual original ARM pause-icon hit103178\u2192104014\u2192107254 at113,965; pause-list65030 draw/64E7C hit places SaveQuit resource0x831 at960,797. ConfirmationYes uses original1089EC\u219288904+88E44 persistence, then SceneMenu. Existing-slot11AA58\u219211AB90\u219212F770nonzero selects pendingScene2; empty slot instead enters CAS.",
  "popup_source": "Actual CI8 NewGame PNG shows red Cancel/X on left798 and green Confirm/check on right1122. Original BD764 sets r3=0x40 and stackarg=0x20; constructor7FA6C stores leftAction at Hint+9C fromr3 and rightAction at+A0 fromstack, so left is Cancel/No40 and right Confirm/Yes20. Apply same type2 mapping to NewGame, TutorialNo and SaveQuitYes.",
  "onboarding_source": "Actual CI9 reaches rendered house/HUD, then a timed New Wish dialog can block Pause. PNG/OCR recognizes only New Wish, Edit Appearance and Recipes; rendered green-check/blue-X pixels determine taps. Require two clear frames. Actual CI10 pause image has four button labels and no title: read Options, Help & About, Save and Continue, Save and Quit to menu with tight per-row OCR, then use the observed last-label center. Verify the exact save-confirmation body and rendered green check before confirming. Unknown panels fail closed; only ordinary UI touches occur. After loading the saved Sim, the final ordinary interaction can open the valid Alex/Edit Appearance context menu; retain that gameplay evidence without applying the onboarding-only dialog classifier.",
  "object_action_source": "Previous real C2 run opened Retro Tall Lamp at raw1250,170 and exposed actual Turn off1233.5,352.75 plus Walk to. The exploratory bed points did not select a bed and no action was sent; this was a harness target failure. The new primary oracle requires exact Retro Tall Lamp title and action, then an opposite-label transition when the same object is normally reselected; menu disappearance alone is insufficient. Camera ladder1834,200\u2192765 remains source-proven; optional Sofa scanning selects only exact Retro Sofa/Sit and never assumes a found object or completed pose. No game memory or save values are written.",
  "shutdown_source": "Original main-menu Quit may be row4or5, so read visible Options/Help/Quit text and click Quit glyph center. Original SceneMenu20 right green action20 calls s3eDeviceRequestQuit. Quit body is Are you sure you want to quit the game?; require body and actual green pixels. AirplayThread.run after runNative logs Native code done. Shutting down, then calling finish on activity and Activity.finish; no System.exit or processkill. Require both log markers, game Main no longer resumed, and no fatal/ANR lines; an idle launcher PID is allowed.",
  "repeat_coverage": "Same frozen C2 hash already passed full female/hair/Home/create/save/reload before the failed bed search. Omit repeated appearance-visible pause, three hair cycles/category and Home/reopen to reach the affected object/quit checks sooner; retain normal female creation, traits/name and real save/reload."
